id=gxr_steamlink_pose_time
name=Galaxy XR Steam Link Pose Time
version=0.1.7
versionCode=107
author=4uva4ek
description=Forwards the consumed controller pose epoch in Steam Link packets as slot label minus a compensation set in the WebUI (0-30 ms, default 15; 28.82 = measured original label lead). Requires Velocity Frame and Steam Link 2.0.20. App-private RAM only; ships disabled. Action reports live status and recovery.
